      "text": [
        "2235 - وَ قَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : «لِيَحْذَرْ أَحَدُكُمْ أَنْ يُعَوِّقَ أَخَاهُ مِنَ اَلْحَجِّ فَتُصِيبَهُ فِتْنَةٌ فِي دُنْيَاهُ مَعَ مَا يُدَّخَرُ لَهُ فِي اَلْآخِرَةِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2235 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said: \"Let none of you hinder his brother from performing Hajj, lest he be afflicted with a trial in this world, in addition to what is reserved for him in the Hereafter.\""
        ]
      }
